    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "① Four connections are mandatory",
      "pos": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "size": [
        570,
        360
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 3,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 正确接线\n\n`timeline_latent`接第一段或上一次本节点输出；`continuation_segment`接**同一Long Video Conditioning经过完整采样后的denoised_output**。Planner与Conditioning的`report_json`必须像本模板一样直接连接，不能手抄。节点会核对chain、segment、画布、render帧数、motion keyframe数和时间线位置，防止把不匹配的段静默拼进去。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "② Full Long Video context, not always five frames",
      "pos": [
        0,
        410
      ],
      "size": [
        570,
        390
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 4,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 时格计算\n\n普通独立段拼接只去5帧前缀；Long Video续段已经把上一段的5/22/39帧作为motion context重新注入，因此必须去掉完整上下文。示例：124帧时间线 + 124帧续段，22帧context后得到226帧，视频latent T=67、音频latent T=377；再接39帧context的124帧续段得到311帧。音频裁剪按累计24fps→40Hz相位计算，不固定写死8、9、37或65步。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "③ Audio-safe default and final-tail rule",
      "pos": [
        1860,
        640
      ],
      "size": [
        700,
        390
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 5,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 音频与最终裁剪\n\n默认`require_video_and_audio`要求Context Load提供上一段画面和音频尾部；`allow_video_only`只在你明确接受音频连续性未被证明时使用。所有段先在latent域合并，只做一次AV VAE Decode。最终段若Planner报告`hidden_tail_frames>0`，必须在**一次解码完成后**按`trim_tail_frames_after_decode`裁掉隐藏尾帧；不要提前裁latent破坏原生时间格。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "④ Scientific boundary",
      "pos": [
        650,
        790
      ],
      "size": [
        1080,
        280
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 6,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 能证明什么\n\n该节点只证明Planner/Conditioning报告对应的5/22/39帧结构及双时钟裁剪精确；报告JSON是本项目节点的接线证据，不是第三方采样器实际消费Conditioning的密码学证明。它不恢复运行中的NFE、Transformer、采样器、队列或CUDA状态，也不自动驱逐ComfyUI缓存。连续性、听感、画质、显存收益和16GB安全仍需独立验收。"
      ]
    }
